  "taal_vir_skrywer": [
    "fix: [taal] in 'Dan praat jy nie lank met die groep nie.': 'Dan' follows directly on the photo sentence and may read as covering only that last case rather than every unsafe situation listed in the block.",
    "fix: [taal] in 'op jou sit om iets te doen': 'druk op jou sit' may be read as echoing English 'put pressure on'; the standard collocation is 'druk op iemand uitoefen', and the proposed 'plaas' echoes English 'place pressure' just as much.",
    "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Die druk kan ook kom sonder dat iemand 'n woord sê. Almal om jou doen ': 'dit' has no clear antecedent: it can be read as 'saying a word' or as the unnamed activity; fixing it means guessing what 'it' is, so it is flagged rather than changed."
  ],
